{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Publish revocation before releasing queued work.** The token is already null, but this flag is set only after `stopPolling()` completes dependent stages. A queued at-least-once step or child handler can start meanwhile, see `false`, perform uncheckpointable side effects, and then run again on replay. Compute and publish the nonterminal-revocation state before stopping pollers or flushing, then signal suspension.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ixoa","finding_digest":"031be425b8c365696fcea7803b2dacf3fa538e7c5ea3854189a9b8de8ea160a1","finding_id":"arf_v1_amn6ijnyynsws36ou6adwlnm6p","finding_key":"sdk/execution/checkpointmanager::handlemissingtoken::revocation-before-worker-release","identity_key":"sdk/execution/checkpointmanager::handlemissingtoken::revocation-before-worker-release","line":296,"observation_digest":"21f379dc2681aaaccb2745cc14a03db4a5dc2136ac33b2367823d052b673e3fc","observation_id":"aro_v1_ehzxtxbgqgvkzszhixgbjib5ws","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/CheckpointManager.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:24:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_s3g3juqjpgk3fy5vaqhszbuq4c","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"34fcb7f40880a2f73c07a36b3bc3d3dfb5f0627e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":296,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":778},"record_id":"art_v1_6vb6rjpd2yykbuucabaucn2jk7","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:24:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
